<view class="page">
  <view class="card profile">
    <view class="avatar">{{isAdmin ? '管' : '球'}}</view>
    <view class="profile-info">
      <view class="row">
        <view class="title">{{nickName || '未设置昵称'}}</view>
        <view class="tag {{isAdmin ? 'tag-open' : 'tag-draft'}}">{{isAdmin ? '管理员' : '成员'}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="muted">openid: {{openid}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="bind-btn" bindtap="bindWechat">绑定微信</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="subtitle">资料设置</view>
    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="label">昵称</view>
      <view class="value"><input placeholder="填写昵称" value="{{nickName}}" bindinput="onNick" /></view>
    </view>
    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="label">手机号</view>
      <view class="value"><input type="number" placeholder="选填" value="{{phone}}" bindinput="onPhone" /></view>
    </view>
    <button class="btn-primary" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">保存资料</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{!isAdmin}}">
    <view class="subtitle">管理员登录</view>
    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="label">密码</view>
      <view class="value"><input password placeholder="输入管理员密码" value="{{adminPwd}}" bindinput="onAdminPwd" /></view>
    </view>
    <button class="btn-primary" disabled="{{loggingIn}}" bindtap="adminLogin">登录为管理员</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="subtitle">使用说明</view>
    <view class="muted">管理员创建活动后，成员在活动详情页选择场地报名接龙；满员自动进入候补，有人退出会按顺序补位；活动时签到，结束后按实际到场人数 AA 分摊费用。</view>
  </view>
</view>
